# Secrets for the XAUUSD auto-paper worker Edge Function — FAKE values only.
# Set real values with `supabase secrets set`; never commit them anywhere.
# The cron POST body is always `{}`; the worker is authenticated by the
# x-worker-secret header. The OANDA credentials are practice-only and the
# worker has no order-capable interface.
XAUUSD_WORKER_CRON_SECRET="replace-with-a-long-random-secret"
OANDA_ACCOUNT_ID="your-oanda-practice-account-id"
OANDA_API_TOKEN="your-oanda-practice-personal-access-token"
SUPABASE_URL="https://your-project-ref.supabase.co"
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY="replace-with-service-role-key"
